Prompts: Role Assignment

Purpose:
  Map functional roles to tech stack and layers based on prompt input.
  Enables human approval of proposed role assignments.

Rules:
  [RA1] Every tech stack element MUST map to exactly one role.
  [RA2] Role assignments MUST be proposed to human for approval.
  [RA3] Provisioning triggers MUST require human approval.
  [RA4] Role changes MUST be recorded in decisions/.

Navigation:
  RoleAssignment: @prompts/INDEX.sdd
  RoleMapper: @prompts/role-assignment/role-mapper.sdd
  HumanApproval: @prompts/role-assignment/human-approval.sdd

State: +
